    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="bea49c4a-b05c-518b-ae1c-446d4565cc79" activityNameId="60c322d6-2dda-5cd2-9cd1-cb7999643db0" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Cable, three-conductor cable, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Cable, three-conductor cable, at plant
The data represent a 1 kV low volage cable with copper wire sheath, type GKN (Ceander / waveconal cable). Material data are taken from datasheet of a producer of such a cable. Infrastructure and production efforts are based on own assumptions. The dataset represents a cable with a meter-weight of 1.04 kg/m. In 2023 updates, material and energy input are now represented by global inventory flows; UUID: 10b19bdd-fb0f-3731-a72c-95fbf2607455
This module includes material, an estimation of the production efforts (transportation, energy, process chemicals, …) and of the infrastructure for the production of a three-conductor cable used in the construction of new buildings. No information about emissions (air, water) and waste are included.
Location: Data from one Swiss producer, used as representative for the global situation.
Technology: Data from one producer of such type of cable.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_10b19bdd-fb0f-3731-a72c-95fbf2607455.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
